    "fix": "Private PRE_H (build/ws-em9305-20261122/u-suffix/bis-cb/pre_beginop.h and pre_tx.h) plants a structured big/ctx, keeps stream counts small, and seeds 0x8051e0 and 0x8052d0 to opencfw_test_cb from extra_cb1.c. 0x1e4 cycles so both the callback path and TxControl's TXCTL_HDR else-path run. Shared lowers/chunks/spec.json was not written. nor0=1 because these are void.",
